exit 1

--- stdout
workflows
  cobranzas   machine/custom   2 phases  routes: completa, sola
  inventario  machine/custom   3 phases  routes: corta, larga
  soporte     machine/shipped  2 phases  routes: completa, directa
  ventas      machine/shipped  4 phases  routes: completa, rapida

claude code  (machine: <work>/out/claude)
  added      /alfred, /alfred-add-workflow, /alfred-cobranzas, /alfred-explore,
             /alfred-init, /alfred-inventario, /alfred-soporte, /alfred-ventas,
             /alfred-workflows-scanner, /alfred-worktree, alfred-apply, alfred-archive,
             alfred-manage, alfred-spec, alfred-ventas-propuesta,
             alfred-ventas-prospectar, alfred-ventas-seguimiento

opencode  (machine: <work>/out/opencode.json)
  added      alfred, alfred-add-workflow, alfred-apply, alfred-archive, alfred-cobranzas,
             alfred-explore, alfred-init, alfred-inventario, alfred-manage,
             alfred-soporte, alfred-spec, alfred-ventas, alfred-ventas-propuesta,
             alfred-ventas-prospectar, alfred-ventas-seguimiento,
             alfred-workflows-scanner, alfred-worktree

without a model
  cobranzas/recordatorio  the workflow's own recordatorio declares no model and will not
                          be dispatched
  ventas/review           the shared phase review has no model in this installation's
                          profile and will not be dispatched
